00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:56.210
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>But these guys are trying to have just one conversation about everything, a conversation that takes into account consent, but also all of their questions and anxieties when it comes to talking to a person they're sleeping with. It seems like that's a conversation they've never had.
