00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:35.860
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>I feel like if we're going to lay the burden of changing the way we talk about sex at the feet of 18-year-olds, people who are already many years into learning weird and bad and confusing information, if that's our answer to reduce sexual assault, I wanted to know more about what these guys actually know and where they learned it.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>我觉得如果我们要把改变我们谈论性方式的重担放在18岁年轻人的肩上，这些人已经多年来在学习奇怪、糟糕且令人困惑的信息，如果这就是我们减少性侵犯的答案，我想更多地了解这些家伙实际上知道什么，以及他们是从哪里学到的。

