00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:41.670
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>But Sami's racism pool is completely drained with a lock on the gate. And we run past it every day on the way to the race pool. And every day that goes by, I feel guilty. The racism pool is treacherous. It's not fun to swim in.
